ven-names></name><name><surname>Ohata</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Harper</surname><given-names>IS</given-names></name><name><surname>Trollinger</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><name><surname>Herman</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Lemasters</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mitochondrial free calcium transients during excitation-contraction coupling in rabbit cardiac myocytes</article-title><source>FEBS Lett</source><year>1996</year><volume>382</volume><fpage>31</fpage><lpage>36</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8612759</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Lederer</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Cannell</surname><given-names>MB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Calcium sparks: elementary events underlying excitation-contraction coupling in heart muscle</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1993</year><volume>262</volume><fpage>740</fpage><lpage>744</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8235594</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Crompton</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Andreeva</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>On the interactions of Ca<sup>2&#x0002b;</sup> and cyclosporin A with a mitochondrial inner membrane pore: a study using cobaltammine complex inhibitors of the Ca<sup>2&#x0002b;</sup>uniporter</article-title><source>Biochem J</source><year>1994</year><volume>302</volume><fpage>181</fpage><lpage>185</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7520694</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Crompton</surname><given-names